  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "_note": [
    "Sizes and digests were taken from the official sources on 2026-08-10, not",
    "from a developer's cache: the separator files were re-downloaded from",
    "GitHub and compared byte for byte, and the Hugging Face digests come from",
    "the Hub's own file-metadata API at the pinned revision.",
    "",
    "Hugging Face entries pin a revision rather than listing every file. The",
    "revision is a commit hash, so it covers the whole tree; the per-file",
    "digests recorded here are the LFS objects, which are fetched separately",
    "and are therefore the part a mirror could substitute.",
    "",
    "download_checks.json deliberately carries no digest: it is an upstream",
    "index on a moving branch, so pinning it would fail every machine the day",
    "upstream edits it. It is fetched once and not verified.",
    "",
    "whisper-ja was added on 2026-09-02 from the same Hub file-metadata API,",
    "and is the one entry that has NOT been through a release drill: no",
    "default run fetches it, so the first machine to pass --model",
    "TransWithAI/whisper-ja-1.5B-ct2 is the one that exercises it.",
    "",
    "nemotron3 was added on 2026-09-25: the safetensors digest is the Hub's",
    "LFS oid, config.json was hashed from the bytes at the pinned URL.",
    "listedOnly fetches just these two files: the repository also carries a",
    ".nemo, a GGUF and demo media the port never opens. speaker-embedding",
    "(same day) is ours; its digests were checked against the Hub's LFS oids",
    "after the upload."
  ],
